SHAH KEHTE THE MERI AANKH KEY TAARE ABBAS<br>
BHAI KO CHORD GAYE KISKEY SAHARE ABBAS<br>
<br>
MAINE BACHPAN MEIN JHULAYA THA TUMHARA JHULA<br>
TUM HO ASGHAR KI TARAH RAJ DULHARE ABBAS<br>
<br>
APNI MASOOM BHATIJI KI MADAD KO AAO<br>
SO NAHI PAATI HEIN WO DARD KEY MAARE ABBAS<br>
<br>
PANI BEHTE HUE MASKIZE SE JIS DAM DEKHA<br>
MERI AANKHAO SE BAHE KHOON KEY DHARE ABBAS<br>
<br>
KOUN CHINEGA RIDA KEHTI THI BINTE ZEHRA<br>
SAB KO HEIN ILM KEY HEIN SATH HAMARE ABBAS<br>
<br>
NEHAIR PE GHAZI KA LASHA THA TADAPTA PAIHAM<br>
HAR TAMACHAOUN PE SAKINA NEY PUKARA ABBAS<br>
<br>
KUCH GHADI PEHLE THEY TUM HATOUN MEIN PARCHAM THAMEIN<br>
AUR AB SOTE HO TUM NEHAIR KINARE ABBAS
